formul8 is a Go port of txm (Terminal TeX Math), a terminal LaTeX math
renderer by thatmagicalcat:

    https://github.com/thatmagicalcat/txm

Ported baseline: commit 26e6d3cfef4d5d040711f4c49d9147aabd350d4d
("add C/C++ bindings", 2026-07-19).

txm is dual-licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0 and carries the notice

    Copyright (c) 2026 thatmagicalcat

formul8 is distributed under the same dual licence. See LICENSE-MIT and
LICENSE-APACHE, which retain the upstream copyright notice.

The Rust sources of txm are not redistributed here. A checkout of the
reference lives at reference/txm in a development clone only, where it serves
as the executable oracle for port parity and is kept out of Git.

Added beyond the reference: the Bmatrix, vmatrix and Vmatrix matrix
environments, tracked in milestone v0.2.0. The matrix, bmatrix and pmatrix
environments, the parser, the layout tree, the renderer and both backends are
ports of the reference.
